sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Scanner screen (Ch 6)
    participant Perm as Permission (Ch 51)
    participant CX as CameraX (bound to lifecycle, Ch 44)
    participant An as BarcodeAnalyzer (off-main)

    User->>UI: open scanner
    UI->>Perm: request CAMERA in context
    Perm-->>UI: granted
    UI->>CX: bind Preview + ImageAnalysis to lifecycleOwner
    CX->>An: frames (keep-only-latest)
    An-->>UI: barcode detected
    User->>UI: close scanner
    UI->>CX: lifecycle STOPPED -> camera released automatically
